msgid ""
"Every party issues from here the documents the call asks of it — the tasks «"
" provide a document » and the decisions on the requests addressed to it — in"
" one structure: header of the call, body of the standard, signatures by "
"role, sealed footer. What the registry knows is pre-filled; the rest is "
"completed and signed on paper, then filed back as a version of the same "
"document."
msgstr ""
